- Delta: **2 files**; production **+3/-1**, tests **+1/-0**. Production growth documents the non-obvious order and places normalization after case conversion; no new execution branch or helper. Author simplification/test audit completed; independent local model review was waived by the user and is not claimed.

Not tested: physical node connections, node command execution, macOS/Windows hardware, agent model calls, external APIs, production state, installed upgrade, PostgreSQL or GUI behavior. This proof establishes native CLI lookup/description against real persisted paired nodes, with shared-consumer contracts checked in source and focused tests. Required PR CI is checked after publication.

