Exact-head native GREEN: **`3fadc60630dd2985d710b5a6b1bb983d44dd37d6`**, **2026-11-10 16:31:37 UTC**, Linux, Node 24.22.1, OpenClaw 2026.11.2, real Chromium **152.0.7977.64**. The test-only follow-ups leave production byte-identical to the initial `eb922b1272656dced5fb24776a479a8cf7bba35e` revision; the build and browser proof were rerun on the final head. Native RED used `96d8a35f3f4626fb818df6cb23974974c3fca6cb`; the report owner and contribution contracts are byte-identical on refreshed main `53aed90ae4c7522f5dae79c6b6d6cb4f0fccf551`.

